# :clock advance rounds half-even to whole microseconds, and refuses a negative duration even when it rounds to nothing (#2329).
> :clock virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00Z
> :clock advance 0.0000005 s
> :clock advance 0.0000015 s
> :clock advance 0.0000025 s
> :clock
virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00.000004Z
> :clock advance -0.0000000001 s
! bad arguments
> :clock
virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00.000004Z
